---
/** Notes for image to Base64; it has no settings, and the tool page and its landing pages share this copy. */
import OptionDetails from '../OptionDetails.astro';
---
<OptionDetails>
  <p>Each image is encoded exactly as it is, with no re-compression, so the Base64 decodes back to the identical file. Base64 text is about a third larger than the image, which suits small icons and logos; large images are better kept as files.</p>
</OptionDetails>
